{"accountName": "奇安信CERT", "author": "奇安信CERT", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "奇安信 CERT 2026-11-04 17:26 北京", "type": "p"}, {"text": "致力于第一时间为企业级用户提供权威漏洞情报和有效解决方案。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555ttYicq7lZMiclDovbO1TuCH3uEiatZVPbNib5c6Wt9rFw3LSJkLGETRBdTPTehxTZob5Oo3Gwa7N7WSRCSAom9MvgWvntNkE3Kdek/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞概述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞名称", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress Core 竞争条件远程代码执行漏洞", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/RwAbCjh555vgosCBy6nas9ZgzRcGu9ib9qPDRicjhhhtR2IoLU0WibHzzlRQjRYn83UgHEdib5QKWeqhOO5lS0OxDYSVLpm9hf5mVBx9Sib7cIH0/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞编号", "type": "p"}, {"text": "QVD-2026-102501 ， CVE-2026-119977", "type": "p"}, {"text": "公开时间", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/RwAbCjh555tMkxUsfzpkKr46Bich2Db98YBULsRKwLiaxpibNJxYheQkxt5srb881Oc6FqZiaolGUd9ibsu6xLG21MqGgonDJ4gafYRhy2licsy8U/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "2026-10-31", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响量级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "百万级", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "图片", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555twzIqxZV4UxO4YicGANgpw0N0zKB4JdAD5ia5dmhoicDn89YnbsdDuDUeoKG0NicYhzTwO2L1QIGHbaibaibdMRzOGDcoMiaibRmDxQ2g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&tp=webp#imgIndex=2", "type": "img"}, {"text": "奇安信评级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "高危", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVSS 3.1分数", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "图片", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/3tG2LbK7WG3tezJEzJsicLSWCGsIggLbcfk4LB5WK7pdSwMksxPOAoHuibjQpBlEId4nyIIw52n2J8N8MowYZcjA/640?wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&wx_co=1&wx_fmt=other&tp=webp#imgIndex=3", "type": "img"}, {"text": "8.1", "type": "p"}, {"text": "威胁类型", "type": "p"}, {"text": "代码执行", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "图片", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/EkibxOB3fs4ibpFEkqfMZfO3smS6RKd9BYBVaibvBq1vXprZIc191LXKibdiaApA16q3UgmibQDv4yW09qT88J3jRUfA/640?wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&wx_co=1&wx_fmt=other&tp=webp#imgIndex=4", "type": "img"}, {"text": "利用可能性", "type": "p"}, {"text": "POC状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "在野利用状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已发现", "type": "p"}, {"text": "EXP状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "未公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "技术细节状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "危害描述： 攻击者可利用该漏洞，在升级窗口内通过竞争条件注入恶意配置，最终实现任意代码执行，导致服务器完全沦陷。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0 1", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞详情", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响组件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 是全球最广泛使用的开源内容管理系统（CMS），基于 PHP 和 MySQL/MariaDB 构建，提供文章发布、页面管理、媒体库、插件扩展与主题换肤等完整建站能力。它既可通过 WordPress.org 官方托管服务使用，也可免费下载自建于各类 Web 服务器环境，凭借丰富的生态和易用性成为个人博客、企业官网、新闻媒体及电商平台的主流选择，目前为全球约 43% 的网站提供底层支撑。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞描述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "近日，奇安信CERT监测到 WordPress Core 竞争条件远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-119977) 在野利用。该漏洞源于完整包核心升级过程中，升级程序将更新包解压至 wp-content/upgrade/ 下基于包名生成的可预测、Web 可访问临时目录（相关代码位于 class-wp-upgrader.php、class-core-upgrader.php、update-core.php 等）。临时目录包含安装程序 setup-config.php，且在升级窗口期间可被外部 HTTP 请求直接执行。攻击者可利用该漏洞，在升级窗口内通过竞争条件注入恶意配置，最终实现任意代码执行，导致服务器完全沦陷。 目前该漏洞PoC和技术细节已公开。 鉴于该漏洞已发现在野利用，建议客户尽快做好自查及防护。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用条件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2.暂存目录可公开访问；", "type": "p"}, {"text": "3.暂存路径可预测。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "02", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响范围", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响版本", "type": "p"}, {"text": "4.8.0 <= WordPress <= 4.8.33", "type": "p"}, {"text": "4.9.0 <= WordPress <= 4.9.34", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.0.0 <= WordPress <= 5.0.30", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.1.0 <= WordPress <= 5.1.27", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.2.0 <= WordPress <= 5.2.29", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.3.0 <= WordPress <= 5.3.26", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.4.0 <= WordPress <= 5.4.24", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.5.0 <= WordPress <= 5.5.23", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.6.0 <= WordPress <= 5.6.22", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.7.0 <= WordPress <= 5.7.20", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.8.0 <= WordPress <= 5.8.18", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.9.0 <= WordPress <= 5.9.19", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6.0.0 <= WordPress <= 6.0.17", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6.1.0 <= WordPress <= 6.1.15", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6.2.0 <= WordPress <= 6.2.14", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6.3.0 <= WordPress <= 6.3.13", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6.4.0 <= WordPress <= 6.4.13", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6.5.0 <= WordPress <= 6.5.13", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6.6.0 <= WordPress <= 6.6.10", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6.7.0 <= WordPress <= 6.7.10", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6.8.0 <= WordPress <= 6.8.11", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6.9.0 <= WordPress <= 6.9.10", "type": "p"}, {"text": "7.0.0 <= WordPress <= 7.0.7", "type": "p"}, {"text": "7.1.0 <= WordPress <= 7.1.3", "type": "p"}, {"text": "注意： 底层脆弱代码自 WordPress 2.7/2.8 引入的内置核心更新器即已存在，2.7-4.6分支已无官方修复版本。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "其他受影响组件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "03", "type": "p"}, {"text": "复现情况", "type": "p"}, {"text": "目前， 奇安信CERT已成功复现 WordPress Core 竞争条件远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-119977) ，截图如下：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "04", "type": "p"}, {"text": "受影响资产情况", "type": "p"}, {"text": "奇安信鹰图资产测绘平台数据显示， WordPress Core 竞争条件远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-119977) 关联的国内风险资产总数为48714个，关联IP总数为14700个。国内风险资产分布情况如下：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress Core 竞争条件远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-119977) 关联的全球风险资产总数为1219476个，关联IP总数为379271个。全球风险资产分布情况如下：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "05", "type": "p"}, {"text": "处置建议", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "安全更新", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 4.7.* >= 4.7.39", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 4.8.* >= 4.8.34", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 4.9.* >= 4.9.35", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 5.0.* >= 5.0.31", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 5.1.* >= 5.1.28", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 5.2.* >= 5.2.30", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 5.3.* >= 5.3.27", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 5.4.* >= 5.4.25", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 5.5.* >= 5.5.24", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 5.6.* >= 5.6.23", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 5.7.* >= 5.7.21", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 5.8.* >= 5.8.19", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 5.9.* >= 5.9.20", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 6.0.* >= 6.0.18", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 6.1.* >= 6.1.16", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 6.2.* >= 6.2.15", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 6.3.* >= 6.3.14", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 6.4.* >= 6.4.14", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 6.5.* >= 6.5.14", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 6.6.* >= 6.6.11", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 6.7.* >= 6.7.11", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 6.8.* >= 6.8.12", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 6.9.* >= 6.9.11", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 7.0.* >= 7.0.8", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WordPress 7.1.* >= 7.1.4", "type": "p"}, {"text": "站点管理员可通过 WordPress 后台进行升级，也可从 WordPress 官方渠道下载最新安装包进行手动更新。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "若站点已开启自动更新，应确认核心版本已成功更新至修复版本。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "官方公告地址：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://wordpress.org/news/2026/10/wordpress-7-1-4/", "type": "p"}, {"text": "临时缓解措施：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1.在升级前通过 Web 服务器配置（.htaccess、Nginx 规则等）拒绝对 /wp-content/upgrade/ 的 HTTP 访问。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2.使用 WAF /防火墙拦截对 setup-config.php 及 wp-content/upgrade 路径的异常请求。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "06", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[1] https://www.wordfence.com/threat-intel/vulnerabilities/wordpress-core/wordpress-core-470-713-unauthenticated-upgrade-window-staged-installer-remote-code-execution", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[2] https://xint.io/blog/wordpress-core-update-attack", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[3] https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-119977", "type": "p"}, {"text": "07", "type": "p"}, {"text": "时间线", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026年11月04日，奇安信 CERT发布安全风险通告。", "typ